{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-service-status#card-zh","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-service-status","commit":"3705ffd4c2debd8d814541be4ceb9889441abde4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-service-status 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的 DeepSeek 服务状态插件。它在输入框工具栏和侧边栏提供可分别开关的状态圆点及详情面板，并在设置页管理 Atom/RSS 订阅地址。插件从 status.deepseek.com 获取事件，解析服务状态、受影响分量和近期事件，并提供 model_status 工具供 agent 查询；读取结果会缓存，失败时保留上次状态。适合希望在 DSH 中查看 DeepSeek 服务状况或排查调用失败的用户。无需 API 密钥，使用默认订阅地址即可，也可在设置中自定义。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1212-1238","lib/index.js:321-350","lib/status.js:21-34"]}
{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-service-status#card-en","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-service-status","commit":"3705ffd4c2debd8d814541be4ceb9889441abde4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-service-status adds DeepSeek status dots, a detail panel and feed settings to the DSH composer and sidebar. It reads Atom/RSS incidents, summarizes affected components, and provides a model_status tool. Results are cached; failed reads retain the last snapshot. Default feeds need no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1212-1238","lib/index.js:321-350","lib/status.js:21-34"]}
