{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-service-status#feature-1","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-service-status","commit":"3705ffd4c2debd8d814541be4ceb9889441abde4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-service-status 的功能「界面状态指示」：在输入框工具栏和侧边栏显示 DeepSeek 状态圆点。分别通过设置页开关控制显示位置，点开可查看整体状态和近期事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1217-1238"]}
