{"unit_id":"chiqianyushao__dsh-service-status#feature-4","repo":"chiqianyushao/dsh-service-status","commit":"3705ffd4c2debd8d814541be4ceb9889441abde4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-service-status 的功能「状态聚合与缓存」：host 按顺序读取 Atom/RSS 并归一化事件，成功结果缓存 60 秒；读取失败时提供上次快照并标为过期。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/status.js:21-34","lib/status.js:612-625"]}
